[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23267] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 20: <require 'DBIx::Class';>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23269] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 21: <```>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23270] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 22: <**2. Using `Mojolicious::Command::Author::generate::cpanfile`**>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23272] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 23: <* **Install the Mojolicious framework (if not already installed):**>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23273] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 24: <```bash>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23275] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 25: <cpanm Mojolicious>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23277] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 26: <```>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23278] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 27: <* **Generate the `cpanfile`:**>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23280] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 28: <```bash>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23281] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 29: <mojo generate cpanfile>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23283] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 30: <```>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23284] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 31: <This command analyzes your Perl source code files (usually located in the `lib` directory) to identify used modules and generates the `cpanfile` accordingly.>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23286] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 32: <**3. Using Carton**>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23288] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 33: <* **Install Carton:**>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23289] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 34: <```bash>. token: 
