[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23300] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 41: <This creates a basic `cpanfile` with some default settings. You can then manually add your project's specific dependencies.>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23301] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 42: <**Key Considerations**>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23303] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 43: <* **Version Constraints:** You can specify version constraints for your dependencies to ensure compatibility and stability. For example>. token: 
[2026-10-10 12:13:45.23304] [1235639] [debug] Processing line 44: <```perl>. token: 
